<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="fissure-stone-fragments">
<span class="c6">Fissure Stone Fragments for Frost Death Knight DPS Phase 3</span></h3>In the new Inferno Protocol Dungeon difficulty, bosses will drop <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>s, which can be used to purchase T11 items. Many of the items listed in this guide, will be sourced from here, making these dungeons instrumental in getting you up to speed for Firelands-raiding. You will find them listed in the guide, along with their prices.<br/>
<br/>
