<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Chest for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>This is a slot where we are looking to farm some Valor points, as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71058/elementium-deathplate-breastplate">
<img alt="Elementium Deathplate Breastplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raiddeathknight_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Deathplate Breastplate</span></a> is just significantly better than all other options available. Until you have enough Valor Points, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60339/magma-plated-battleplate">
<img alt="Magma Plated Battleplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Magma Plated Battleplate</span></a> will serve you well.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Peerless Stats</span></a>
<div class="pad"></div>
