<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Wrist for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>The wrist slot is easy, as we have multiple great options. However <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60228/bracers-of-the-matredor">
