<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Waist for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65369/sky-strider-belt">
<img alt="Sky Strider Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sky Strider Belt</span></a> is the best by a fair margin, so make sure you run your Inferno Protocol Dungeons and obtain this.<div class="pad"></div>
<b>Recommended BiS Waist Enchant for Engineers</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=41118/nitro-boosts">
