<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Legs for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>We lack good options with Mastery here, but <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71061/elementium-deathplate-greaves">
<img alt="Elementium Deathplate Greaves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_plate_raiddeathknight_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Deathplate Greaves</span></a> are the easy choice due to the higher item level and sockets. If you are unable to obtain these, just grab the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60342/magma-plated-legplates">
<img alt="Magma Plated Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Magma Plated Legplates</span></a> from the Justice Points-vendor, as they are a great option and you will accumulate loads of Justice Points while farming dungeons. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56550/dragonscale-leg-armor">
