<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Feet for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>Our absolute best available option is a craftable from Blacksmithing, tied to the Firelands reputation. This means, that it might not be instantly available. However, once it does become available, you should absolutely get them crafted, as they will last you well into Firelands Heroic raiding.<br/>
