<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">
<span class="c6">Jewelry for Frost Death Knight DPS</span></h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-frost-dps">Neck for Frost DPS</h4>There's just one item here that stands tall above the rest. Luckily, it is also quite easy to obtain. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69885/cloudburst-necklace">
<img alt="Cloudburst Necklace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloudburst Necklace</span></a> can be bought for Fissure Stone Fragments, making it a complete no-brainer. The stats aren't amazing, but the item level and higher stat budget makes it the best option by far.<div class="pad"></div>
