<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Rings for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>We have many good options here that are all quite similar in terms of power. However <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60226/dargonaxs-signet">
<img alt="Dargonax's Signet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubystar.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dargonax's Signet</span></a> will last until you have obtained both BiS rings from Firelands.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74215/enchant-ring-strength">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Strength</span></a> -  Only Enchanters may apply Ring Enchants on their own rings.<div class="pad"></div>
