<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Trinkets for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>Trinkets are a bit interesting, but fortunately relatively easy to acquire. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65072/heart-of-rage">
<img alt="Heart of Rage" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ahnqirajtrinket_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Rage</span></a> should be obtained while farming pre-bis without too many issues. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68972/apparatus-of-khazgoroth">
<img alt="Apparatus of Khaz'goroth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Apparatus of Khaz'goroth</span></a> can either be bought from the Auction House or be obtained while farming trash in Firelands for your ring and belt, if you're lucky. Note that this can be upgraded to your phase BiS trinket later on, so make sure you get this.<div class="pad"></div>
