<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">
<span class="c6">Weapons for Frost Death Knight DPS</span></h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Main Hand Weapons for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>Another item to be obtained from Firelands trash is the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71362/obsidium-cleaver">
